     contacts) for ~5 us, giving ~2x wall-clock speedup while the simulated
     trajectory stays identical to within 1e-6 (well inside atol = 1e-5).
     The solver tolerance is tightened so the constraint residual is below the
     reference solver's, keeping the state match tight. -->
